  "notes": [
    "Preregistered gates: py_compile and an exact synthetic terminal-block check first; 4,096-hand smoke must have finite losses, no KL stop, lambda=1 manifest/metrics evidence, exact fixed-pool accounting, and unchanged architecture. On PASS, run 262,144 actual hands with seed 20260852/worker seed 2026085200 and archive every 16 updates. Evaluate four frozen archives on the untouched seed20260853 1,024-pair three-anchor curve; Slumbot only if paired deltas are direction-consistent and robust.",
    "Synthetic two-hand terminal-block check PASS: lambda=1 returns equal exact discounted Monte-Carlo returns [1.998, 2.0, -0.999, -1.0] despite arbitrary inherited value estimates.",
    "Smoke gate PASS at 4,136 actual hands: manifest and trainer stdout prove gae_lambda=1.0; fixed-pool terminal audit passed with exact anchors, assignment chain, global normalization, preserved architecture, optimizer step 28, zero KL stops, max source KL 0.00008273, and zero clip fraction.",
    "Production gate PASS: 263,581 actual environment hands across 64 updates with manifest gae_lambda=1.0. Terminal audit verified immutable fixed anchors, assignment RNG/hash chain, global normalization, optimizer step 1794, four archive boundaries and hashes, zero KL stops, max source KL 0.00120513, and zero clip fraction.",
    "Frozen matched curve used four archived checkpoints, the untouched seed-20260853 1,024-pair stream, all three original anchors, and aligned raw pair outcomes. Only 3/12 deltas were positive, mean -1.239 and median -0.494 bb/100, no checkpoint improved all anchors, and every paired 95% interval crossed zero."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "A valid 263,581-hand lambda-1 Monte-Carlo GAE treatment remained numerically stable but produced only 3/12 positive matched deltas and a negative mean/median versus the untouched lambda-0.95 control.",
    "conclusion": "Eliminating critic bootstrap from actor advantages did not improve robust general strength in the head-only PPO lineage; the matched curve was predominantly negative and no checkpoint cleared the multi-anchor gate.",
    "decision": "REJECT_MONTE_CARLO_GAE_NO_ROBUST_GAIN",
    "next_step": "Do not scale or Slumbot-test lambda 1.0 unchanged. Select a more substantial optimization-target or policy-data intervention; retain lambda 0.95 as the current control default."
